{"id":"615819","name":"冰花荠菜煎饺","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/615819/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"馅料","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面团","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"小许"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"小许"},{"name":"清水","amount":"150g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"荠菜炖成末。","img":"images/615819/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"房食盐、鸡精、食用油和生抽。","img":"images/615819/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/615819/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取面团，分成小剂子。","img":"images/615819/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"压扁。","img":"images/615819/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/615819/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"包成饺子。","img":"images/615819/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/615819/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"油热放饺子。","img":"images/615819/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"底部煎金黄。","img":"images/615819/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"摆好。","img":"images/615819/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取面粉和淀粉。","img":"images/615819/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放清水搅拌成面糊水。","img":"images/615819/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"沿锅边倒入。","img":"images/615819/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"盖锅盖，中火煎。","img":"images/615819/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"汤汁几乎收干，开锅盖，改大火。","img":"images/615819/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"底部金黄即可。","img":"images/615819/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"用锅铲可以整个铲起来即可。","img":"images/615819/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/615819/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"整理一下即可。","img":"images/615819/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}